  "label": "User projected onto the textual material describing racial segregation",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'white people after they put the divider in between your groceries' because the phrase uses 'your groceries' which implies a direct address to the viewer (the user) as the recipient of the discriminatory action. The user is positioned as the 'you' in the scenario, experiencing the racial segregation depicted. This projection is hateful as it frames the user as a victim of racial discrimination in a mundane setting, reinforcing anti-Black stereotypes by making the viewer identify with the targeted group.",
